      "source": [
        "# Fake News Classification\n",
        "\n",
        "This project aims to develop a neural network for detecting fake news in Portuguese, using the datasets [Fake.br-Corpus](https://github.com/roneysco/Fake.br-Corpus), [FakeTrue.br](https://github.com/jpchav98/FakeTrue.Br) and [FakeRecogna](https://github.com/Gabriel-Lino-Garcia/FakeRecogna).\n",
        "\n",
        "With this, we seek to create a system capable of identifying patterns and distinguishing fake news from real news, contributing to the fight against misinformation."
      ]
    },
